    {
     "id": "pr-4eelkz",
     "type": "text",
     "x": 40,
     "y": 452,
     "w": 580,
     "h": 248,
     "valign": "top",
     "fill": null,
     "lineColor": null,
     "paras": [
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "多選後按「群組」。之後點群組裡任何一個成員都會",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "選到整組",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，可以整組搬移與縮放；",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "雙擊可以進去",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "改單一成員。要拆開，在單選或多選面板按「解散」。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "群組本身沒有座標",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，成員各自獨立。所以右欄那組 X／Y／寬／高指的是",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "包圍盒",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：改 X／Y 是整組平移，改寬／高是以包圍盒左上角為不動點縮放整組，可以鎖比例，也可以連字級一起縮。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
