         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "。雙擊表格儲存格是改內容，雙擊圖表是改 option。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
