         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "−",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": " 與 ",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "＋",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": " 調縮排層級。每一層 18pt，就是 PowerPoint 預設的 0.25 吋，且是懸掛縮排——文字換行後會對齊到第一行的文字，不會跑到符號底下。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "匯出成原生的清單（",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "buChar",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "fontFace": "Menlo"
        },
        {
         "text": "／",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "buAutoNum",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "fontFace": "Menlo"
        },
        {
         "text": "），在 PowerPoint 裡還是真的清單，不是手打的符號。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "段前與段後間距",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "跟行距是分開的兩件事：行距管一段內部每一行的高度，段前段後管兩段之間的空隙。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "行距",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "以「×字級」計算，文字框與表格都可以設。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
