         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "只想改內建形狀的一兩個角",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，不必從零重畫：按「形狀 → 幾何」的",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "轉成可編輯端點",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，形狀會原地拆成端點並開啟編輯器，",
