    {
     "id": "pr-p3rnvx",
     "type": "text",
     "x": 40,
     "y": 452,
     "w": 580,
     "h": 248,
     "valign": "top",
     "fill": null,
     "lineColor": null,
     "paras": [
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "按",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "左側頁面欄底部的「母版」",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "進入（沒啟用時那顆鈕會一併啟用）。畫布會切成母版編輯狀態：整圈橘色框，底部有橘色提示列，你不會搞不清楚自己在改哪裡。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "放進去的元素會出現在",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "每一頁",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，改一次全部跟著變。一般工具全部照用——文字、形狀、圖片、圖表、漸層、陰影、超連結、自訂幾何都行。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "單一頁面可以勾",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "「本頁不套母版」",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，封面常常需要。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "匯出方式二選一",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，切換只改一個旗標、不動母版內容，可以隨時來回比較： ",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": " ",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "放在母版上",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：寫進 PowerPoint 的版面配置，檔案最小。代價是",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "單張投影片複製到別的簡報時，母版內容不會跟著走",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "畫進每一頁",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：匯出時把母版內容實際畫成每一頁的圖形，",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "整張搬得走",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "。代價是圖片的位元組每頁各存一份，檔案會變大。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
